        "name": "Rathauja",
        "theme": "Mercury rules the 2nd and 5th houses from Aryama, so this Yaksha governs the face, wealth, what we need close to us, and our constant creative activity. Rathauja carries the energy of the chariot as seen in the face: the visible expression of whether a person is living in accordance with the energy they actually have. The 5th house is the 8th from the 10th, making it the house of longevity for one's career. Lasting work comes from repeatedly expending the energy you actually have, not the energy you wish you had.",
